perf/style: optimize TouraLuxe modals, unify card, polish animations

Performance & Latency Optimizations:
- Migrated frontend fetching to GET /api/packages and /api/destinations.
- Implemented Cache-Control (30s s-maxage, 120s stale-while-revalidate).
- Deferred heavy package modal content mounting by 750ms.

Unified Component Consolidation:
- Consolidated main and UI PackageCard versions into one unified file.
- Supported compact, editorial, and trending variants.
- Removed duplicate ui/PackageCard.tsx file.

Visual & Aesthetic Polish:
- Added elastic.out bouncy heading entrance animations to Hero, About, and Services.
- Removed horizontal line dividers from package card layouts.
- Fixed hero image fade-in flash by removing initial opacity transitions.
- Added spring curve animations to tooltips on WhatsApp and voice pills.

Mobile & Layout Refinements:
- Replaced CPU-intensive backdrop-blur filters on badges with solid opaque fills.
- Added safety guards for matchData to prevent ghost badge container rendering.
- Added bottom padding to Explore heading to prevent descender clipping.
- Optimized DestinationNavbar responsive paddings to prevent Back button overlap.
